Package: com.mikiyan1978.switchergrid
Name: SwitcherGrid
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Displays the App Switcher (multitasking) screen as Apple's built-in iPad-style grid instead of the default horizontal carousel. Swipe down on any card to kill all open apps at once.
Maintainer: mikiyan1978
Author: mikiyan1978
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, com.opa334.altlist
Icon: /Library/PreferenceBundles/SwitcherGridPrefs.bundle/icon@3x.png
